  "notes": "USAGE:\nAn important distinction exists between {節税|せつぜい} (legal tax saving) and {脱税|だつぜい} (illegal tax evasion). {節税|せつぜい} refers to reducing taxes through proper, lawful methods.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {節税|せつぜい}{対策|たいさく} (tax-saving measures)\n- {節税|せつぜい}{効果|こうか} (tax-saving effect)\n- {節税|せつぜい}する (to save on taxes)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {脱税|だつぜい}: tax evasion — illegally avoiding taxes\n- {減税|げんぜい}: tax cut — a reduction in tax rates enacted by the government",
